"""
RNAmotifs-MaRs integrates RNAmotifs motif discovery with eCLIP RBP binding
data to compute MRM-RBP association scores. The pipeline:

  1. Runs RNAmotifs with multiple hw/ew parameter combinations
  2. Computes signal recovery rate (SCORE1) from eCLIP downsampling
  3. Computes profile similarity (SCORE2) via cosine similarity
  4. Generates association score heatmaps
"""

